$MDESC::Type = "CTF Mixed";
$MDESC::Text = "				\n<f2>***WARNING:  THIS IS AN EXPERT ONLY MAP***" @
	 
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Death" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Foggy and Snowing" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> face each other on the 2nd most difficult battlefield they have ever played on.  The ultimate goal is to capture the other team's flag five times.  The minefield is controled by the center objectives.  Land on the wrong square and die.  Figure out which squares are yours and reach the other team's base to grab their flag.  Good luck on making it back." @
         "\n\n<f1>Map engineered and designed by:<f0> EEPROM (Mappers Extreme)" @
         "\n<f2>This map is based on the great map by Goldberg called MineSweeper."@
         "\n<f2>You can find this map at www.planetstarsiege.com/extreme or www.resistanceimaging.com/pms";
